-to bipartite Vertex Cover; Hopcroft-Karp plus Konig's construction returns a
-minimum cover in polynomial time.  The reference implementation deliberately
-performs the standard explicit-edge scan of the compactly specified regular
-graph before matching, and reports its measured edge operations and wall time.
-The compact route uses the paper's skew-sum decomposition to ignore all safe
-blocks symbolically, then alternates along the odd obstruction paths.  Thus this
-is Track B no-tool compression, not a distributional or complexity-theoretic
-hardness claim.
-
