          "       standard algorithm for the problem class too (SAT/ILP/spectral/LLL/\n"
          "       DLX -- see prompts/codex_task.md, G6). If you truly cannot run it,\n"
          "       record it as an attack entry saying so and name it in the README.")
    sys.exit(1)
