+def random_candidate(inst: dict[str, Any], rng: random.Random) -> object:
+    """Sample the two obvious answer forms with equal prior weight.
 
+    Uniform sampling over their disjoint union would put essentially all mass
+    on long explicit maps and understate the much better symbolic guessing
+    strategy.  Equal form weight is the conservative, solver-aware prior.
